# Left out since the 0.3.6 flow pass: Camp Mojache (7492, Gorlach's 1500 XP delivery to Talo): it cost a flight from
# Gadgetzan to Camp Mojache and on to Marshal's Refuge instead of the direct flight.
# Added here (0.3.6 flow pass, from 50-60/01, where the guide was about 52.4 among level 54-57 mobs): Light's Hope
# Chapel's flight path and bind, Pamela's doll (5149), Zaeldarr (6021), Uncle Carlin (5241) and Defenders of
# Darrowshire (5211), and the Marlene/Chromie chain (5152, 5153, 5154) to Brother Carlin (5210). Brother Carlin opens
# Heroes and Villains of Darrowshire (5168, 5181), so the chain comes first.

