step Eastern Plaguelands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The high elf Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen guard the lodge by Northpass Tower; the Registry lies inside. Rangers reach 60: pull one at a time. Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields on the way.
