# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Corin's Crossing and back west

step Corin's Crossing
  tip Ride south from the lodge to Corin's Crossing, on the road. Living Rot spoils within ten minutes: kill the town's Scourge quickly and grind the seven pieces with the Mortar and Pestle at once.
  tip Careful: Unseen Servants call for help within 25 yd once they drop to 40% health. Out of combat they also turn invisible with Greater Invisibility. If a call for help happens inside the town, a large number of mobs can join the fight. Fighting near the outskirts lowers this risk.
  tip With Defenders of Darrowshire in your log (from Carlin at the start of this guide), the Scourge around the town leave Darrowshire Spirits: talk to each one to free it. Free them before you start on the Living Rot.
  goto 52.3,58.2 "Corin's Crossing" live
  kill 11064 quest 5211.1 "Free Darrowshire Spirits: talk to them"
  collect 15447 x7
  complete 6022

step Nathanos Blightcaller
  tip Ride west to the Marris Stead.
  turnin 6133
  turnin 6042
  turnin 6022

