step Gaeriyan
  tip Drink the Videre Elixir at the graveyard just east of Gadgetzan: it kills you, and only as a ghost can you see Gaeriyan, in a rocky crevice in the hills due north of it. Talk to him there, then run back to your body and resurrect: the Conspicuous Gravestone he sends you to stands in that graveyard.
  use 11243 @54.0,28.7 map 1446         -- Videre Elixir
  turnin 3912
  accept 3913

